{"id":"grundstu_ck","lemma":"Grundstück","pos":"noun","rank":2952,"glosses":["land, parcel, real estate"],"ipa":"/ˈɡʁʊntˌʃtʏk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/35/De-Grundst%C3%BCck.ogg/De-Grundst%C3%BCck.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Grundstückes","plural":"Grundstücke"},"examples":[{"text":"Dieses Grundstück gehört mir.","en":"I own this property.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"}]},{"text":"Ich muss Sie bitten, mein Grundstück zu verlassen.","en":"I'm going to have to ask you to get off my property.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to ask"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to leave, to abandon"}]},{"text":"Dieses Grundstück ist ideal für unser Haus.","en":"This site is ideal for our house.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"ideal"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"our"},{"g":"house, building"}]},{"text":"In den USA haben viele Leute Zäune um ihre Grundstücke.","en":"In America, many people have fences around their homes.","words":[{"g":"in"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"have"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},{"g":"people"},{"g":"fence","l":"Zaun"},{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null]},{"text":"Wir lieben es, Bienen hier auf dem Grundstück zu haben.","en":"We love having bees on the property.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/746699","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to love"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"bee","l":"Biene"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[8,10,"available"]]}]}